e(AttributeTargets.Class)]\npublic class GodotClassNameAttribute\n  : Attribute\n\n[GodotClassName(\"HTTPRequest\")]\npublic partial class HttpRequest : Node\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3443056812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3443060886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111990#issuecomment-3443060886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111990","id":3443060886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NOPCW","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T13:04:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T13:04:16Z","body":"Yes, but the problem is likely that the dialog doesn't attach the class to the correct parent class because of the difference in naming, which might be a deeper bug in 